comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-04T06:06:49.202Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-08-04: searched all statuses for the exact graph/run.ts, item-format.ts, Sentry, normalizeBootstrapInvocation, and static-analysis terms. pm-zt1c and pm-xsth are closed historical spread waves at different or earlier sites; pm-92if is the canonical open quality parent and no matching active child exists."
  "2026-08-04T06:47:44.834Z","harness:codex","Evidence before publication: removed every supplied unnecessary-spread, undefined-value, insufficient-null-check, unused declaration/import/parameter, useless-array, and stale-call-signature finding without suppressions. Added complete top-level bot acknowledgement commands to scripts/reviews/pr-review-loop.mjs and documented exact-head blocking review workflow. Linked focused suite passed 674/674; full coverage passed 6800/6800 at 100/100/100/100; linked ESLint/duplication/static gate and typecheck passed; full pnpm lint passed including SDK entrypoint and CLI transport floors. pm validate reports history drift 0 and storage integrity ok; pre-existing resolution metadata warning remains 295 closed items."
  "2026-08-04T07:08:32.965Z","harness:codex","Review round evidence: PR #892 exact head 2e47758 received three actionable bot threads. Implemented marker-based idempotent top-level acknowledgements with explicit partial-write reporting, both comment-first and reaction-first failure coverage, the missing success-output assertion, and a bot/outcome-explicit documentation example. Focused review-loop suite passes 11/11; first full coverage run passed 6801/6801 tests and identified only the newly added uncovered branches, which are now covered. Repository lint semantic gates passed; the local SDK import timing gate was host-load limited at 423-424ms versus 367ms without changing its budget, while the prior exact head and hosted exact-head gate passed."
  "2026-08-04T07:27:52.931Z","harness:codex","Final exact-head evidence for PR #892: commit 30a756147 has every GitHub runner/check complete and green, mergeState CLEAN, DeepScan 0 new and 28 fixed, CodeFactor 0 annotations, hosted-analysis gate passed, SDK import costs 10/10 and CLI transport floor 6/6 passed, full local coverage passed 6801/6801 at 100/100/100/100, and all three actionable review threads are implemented/resolved. Every bot artifact was read, reacted to, and answered. Sourcery returned no new findings; CodeRabbit confirmed both fixes and then reported a free included-review limit without new findings. Greptile CLI returned free_reviews_limit_reached, recorded as provider unavailability rather than approval. Sentry live gate: 14-day access ok, 0 critical/high, telemetry error rate 0.73%, 0 missing error codes. Telemetry collector health is current; recent background delivery reduced queue 6 to 3, while the bounded explicit retry failed and the remaining records were preserved."
  "2026-08-04T07:35:00.089Z","harness:codex","Post-close CI evidence: final PM-only head b080675ae failed only Gates (static) because closing this item made the generated CHANGELOG.md stale. Regenerated through pnpm changelog:pm; no source/static quality gate failed. CHANGELOG.md is now linked to this canonical item and the exact static pipeline is being rerun."
